{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10231045","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10231045","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1023104501:1":{"text":"안녕하세요, 어르신! 혹시 로리엣이라는 아가씨를 알고 계신가요?","source_cn":"你好，尊敬的长者，请问您是否认识一位名叫罗丽叶的年轻小姐？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74918745682F8919","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1023104502:1":{"text":"아, 옆 마을 줄리오와 친하게 지낸다는 그 로리엣 말이군!","source_cn":"你们说的罗丽叶，是那个与邻村的朱密欧交往甚密的女孩吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84ED3D27F1BDFE29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1023104503:1":{"text":"맞아요. 혹시 그 두 사람 아직도 연락을 주고받나요?","source_cn":"没错，他们最近还保持着密切的联系吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE545506B2F0BC22E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1023104504:1":{"text":"그건 잘 모르겠네. 로리엣의 아버지가 성격이 좀 괴팍하거든. 그래서 마을 주민들이랑 사이가 좋지 않아.","source_cn":"噢，这个我可就不大清楚了。毕竟罗丽叶的父亲脾气实在是有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36AB8EC70D676414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:热心的老人家":{"text":"열정적인 노인","source":"热心的老人家","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}